ing and cleaner air, too. Charcoal filter removes fumes and odors that are released from foods during cooking.Gets kitchen odors outta here. The 300 CFM motor quickly moves odors and steam away from the cooktop surface.17 H x 23.8125 W x 16.1875 D", "show_backorder_message": false, "tags": [], "warranty": "{\"BenefitCopy\":[{\"Feature\":\"Sensor cooking\",\"Copy\":\"Smart tech takes the guesswork out of cooking. Sensor cooking feature adjusts cooking time and power level automatically, ensuring food is cooked perfectly.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--6ZoGYk8X--/a48b3a92e38cbb89263427cbe6b6231c79259b01.jpg\",\"Video\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YGfD_ys6BGg\"},{\"Feature\":\"Charcoal filter\",\"Copy\":\"Enjoy cooking and cleaner air, too. Charcoal filter removes fumes and odors that are released from foods during cooking\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--vtYPQC0m--/fa892c77b2803cc799fd42d6f6e912d35af40601.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"300 CFM motor\",\"Copy\":\"Gets kitchen odors outta here. The 300 CFM motor quickly moves odors and steam away from the cooktop surface\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--M1IKM32G--/1f2160f6eec41680ef27e23289ca9f5e8c868cc3.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"Ten Power Levels\",\"Copy\":\"Provides a variety of power levels to accommodate all cooking needs\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--QTXvmwhc--/f3e3b4b29f921dbe63184ec8e2715e6c0dadc627.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"1,000 Watt Cooking Power\",\"Copy\":\"Designed to deliver fast and even results, this microwave ensures your meals are cooked to perfection every time\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--6ZoGYk8X--/a48b3a92e38cbb89263427cbe6b6231c79259b01.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"13.6\\\" Diameter Turntable\",\"Copy\":\"The spacious 13.6-inch turntable easily accommodates large plates and bowls to ensure even heating\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--tgVb9rxu--/28961962eefc86247ed13b4f86454e2ea30d51f4.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"LED interior & surface lighting\",\"Copy\":\"See your cooking skills in action. Interior and cooktop LED lighting distribute bright, clear light across all cooking surfaces.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--x9aV4Lt5--/444af2442682524efd312613f7dc0275c677ceaf.jpg\",\"Video\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BzbZ72dj2Js\"},{\"Feature\":\"Electronic Controls with LED\",\"Copy\":\"LED display controls allow for easier usability and legibility\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--anHfKssH--/d1dca2325535d4ceddea9e438b7ddfa90c32eca9.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"Recirculating and venting options\",\"Copy\":\"You take care of the cooking. It takes care of the smell. Flexible installation for any kitchen, with charcoal filter included.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--pV-ra337--/883408de8e8ca538491406a9b072a5e5fc4462d0.jpg\",\"Video\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YaVUaAwTT0M\"},{\"Feature\":\"Hidden Vent\",\"Copy\":\"Gives the microwave a sleek exterior appearance while making it simpler to clean\"},{\"Feature\":\"Auto-on venting\",\"Copy\":\"Heat sensor that activates the vent fan if unit becomes too hot from the cooking surface below\"}], \"variants\":[]}", "price": {"without_tax": {"formatted": "$499.00", "value": 499, "currency": "USD"}, "tax_label": "Tax", "rrp_without_tax": {"formatted": "$599.00", "value": 599, "currency": "USD"}, "saved": {"formatted": "$100.00", "value": 100, "currency": "USD"}}, "detail_messages": "", "availability": "", "page_title": "", "default_shipping_expectation_prompt": "We ship available items right away, and backordered items as soon as they're in stock", "height": "21.00", "cart_url": "https://www.haierappliances.com/cart.php", "show_backorder_availability_prompt": false, "max_purchase_quantity": 1, "show_quantity_on_hand": false, "show_default_shipping_expectation_prompt": false, "show_quantity_on_backorder": false, "brand": {"name": "